      "value": "<p><strong>Echo Sense.</strong> Your attention runs slightly ahead of the present.</p><ul><li>You gain a small bonus to Perception and Insight checks, and your passive Perception and passive Insight improve.</li><li>You often notice emotional or metaphysical \"echoes\" a moment before events hit.</li><li>In Bad Eden play, this is represented by OP and encounter flags rather than automatic rolls.</li></ul>",
